<div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt druid-container-relicpopup" id="druid-container-1"><div><div class="druid-title">Ring of the Snake</div></div><div class="druid-section-container"><div><div class="druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs"><div class="druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused" data-druid="1-1" data-druid-tab-key="Normal">Normal</div></div></div></div><div class="druid-section-container relic-popup-topinfo"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Rarity relic-popup-rarity" data-druid-section-row="TopInfo"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Rarity druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<span class="plainlink" data-name="Relics"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Relics_List?rarity=Starter"><span class="starter-font">Starter Relic</span></a></span></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Character relic-popup-character" data-druid-section-row="TopInfo"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Character druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<span class="plainlink" data-name="Relics"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Relics_List?character=Silent"><span class="silent-text">Silent Only</span></a></span></div></div></div><div class="druid-section-container relic-popup-imagewrap"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Back relic-popup-back" data-druid-section-row="RelicImages"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Back druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<img alt="RelicBacking.png" src="/images/thumb/RelicBacking.png/184px-RelicBacking.png?9346b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="184" height="184" srcset="/images/thumb/RelicBacking.png/276px-RelicBacking.png?9346b5 1.5x, /images/RelicBacking.png?9346b5 2x" data-file-width="312" data-file-height="312" /></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Frame relic-popup-frame" data-druid-section-row="RelicImages"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Frame druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<img alt="RelicFrameCommon.png" src="/images/thumb/RelicFrameCommon.png/224px-RelicFrameCommon.png?46711a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="224" height="224" srcset="/images/RelicFrameCommon.png?46711a 1.5x" data-file-width="312" data-file-height="312" /></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Image relic-popup-base" data-druid-section-row="RelicImages"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Image druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<a href="/wiki/File:RingoftheSnake.png" class="image"><img alt="RingoftheSnake.png" src="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/106px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="106" height="106" srcset="/images/RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 1.5x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a></div></div></div><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Description relic-popup-desc" data-druid-section-row="BottomInfo"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Description druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<div class="game-highlight remove-icons"> At the start of each combat, draw 2 additional cards.</div></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Flavor relic-popup-flavor" data-druid-section-row="BottomInfo"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Flavor druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
Made from a fossilized snake. Represents great skill as a huntress.</div></div></div></div>
<p><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ring of the Snake" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake" title="Ring of the Snake"><img alt="RingoftheSnake.png" src="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/24px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/36px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 1.5x, /images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/48px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Ring of the Snake</a></span> is the <span class="plainlink" data-name="Relics"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Relics_List?rarity=Starter"><span>Starter</span></a></span> <a href="/wiki/Relic" class="mw-redirect" title="Relic">Relic</a> of the <a href="/wiki/Silent" title="Silent">Silent</a>; they will always start every new run with it in their possession and it can't be obtained by any other character.
</p><p>It can be upgraded into the <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ring of the Serpent" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Serpent" title="Ring of the Serpent"><img alt="RingoftheSerpent.png" src="/images/thumb/RingoftheSerpent.png/24px-RingoftheSerpent.png?9110b2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RingoftheSerpent.png/36px-RingoftheSerpent.png?9110b2 1.5x, /images/thumb/RingoftheSerpent.png/48px-RingoftheSerpent.png?9110b2 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Serpent" title="Ring of the Serpent">Ring of the Serpent</a></span> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Relics"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Relics_List?rarity=Boss"><span>Boss Relic</span></a></span> if it's found in a Boss Chest.
</p>
