<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Interactions">Interactions</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Interactions" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Interactions"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Synergies">Synergies</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Synergies" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Synergies"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li>Combined with one of <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Bag of Preparation" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Bag_of_Preparation" title="Bag of Preparation"><img alt="BagofPreparation.png" src="/images/thumb/BagofPreparation.png/24px-BagofPreparation.png?9d3fc5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BagofPreparation.png/36px-BagofPreparation.png?9d3fc5 1.5x, /images/thumb/BagofPreparation.png/48px-BagofPreparation.png?9d3fc5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Bag_of_Preparation" title="Bag of Preparation">Bag of Preparation</a></span> or <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Snecko Eye" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye"><img alt="SneckoEye.png" src="/images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/24px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/36px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a 1.5x, /images/thumb/SneckoEye.png/48px-SneckoEye.png?9be98a 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Snecko_Eye" title="Snecko Eye">Snecko Eye</a></span>, the player can draw 9 cards on the first turn of combat.</li>
<li>More cards can be discarded from the opening hand and re-drawn with <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Gambling Chip" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Gambling_Chip" title="Gambling Chip"><img alt="GamblingChip.png" src="/images/thumb/GamblingChip.png/24px-GamblingChip.png?61381e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GamblingChip.png/36px-GamblingChip.png?61381e 1.5x, /images/thumb/GamblingChip.png/48px-GamblingChip.png?61381e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Gambling_Chip" title="Gambling Chip">Gambling Chip</a></span>.</li>
<li>More cards are drawn to spend energy on during turn 1 with <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Lantern" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Lantern" title="Lantern"><img alt="Lantern.png" src="/images/thumb/Lantern.png/24px-Lantern.png?6d8a8e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Lantern.png/36px-Lantern.png?6d8a8e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Lantern.png/48px-Lantern.png?6d8a8e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Lantern" title="Lantern">Lantern</a></span> and <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ancient Tea Set" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ancient_Tea_Set" title="Ancient Tea Set"><img alt="AncientTeaSet.png" src="/images/thumb/AncientTeaSet.png/24px-AncientTeaSet.png?4ca779" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/AncientTeaSet.png/36px-AncientTeaSet.png?4ca779 1.5x, /images/thumb/AncientTeaSet.png/48px-AncientTeaSet.png?4ca779 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ancient_Tea_Set" title="Ancient Tea Set">Ancient Tea Set</a></span>.</li>
<li>Potentially more <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Attack&amp;color=Green"><span>attacks</span></a></span> could be drawn on turn 1 to take advantage of <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mutagenic Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Mutagenic_Strength" title="Mutagenic Strength"><img alt="MutagenicStrength.png" src="/images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/24px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/36px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e 1.5x, /images/thumb/MutagenicStrength.png/48px-MutagenicStrength.png?86eb1e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Mutagenic_Strength" title="Mutagenic Strength">Mutagenic Strength</a></span> before its effect expires.</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Anti-Synergies">Anti-Synergies</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Anti-Synergies" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Anti-Synergies"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li>It's possible for the additional card draw of <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ring of the Snake" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake" title="Ring of the Snake"><img alt="RingoftheSnake.png" src="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/24px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/36px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 1.5x, /images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/48px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Ring of the Snake</a></span> to be wasted if the player has multiple effects that can add more cards to the starting hand (such as <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ninja Scroll" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ninja_Scroll" title="Ninja Scroll"><img alt="NinjaScroll.png" src="/images/thumb/NinjaScroll.png/24px-NinjaScroll.png?5e08bc" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/NinjaScroll.png/36px-NinjaScroll.png?5e08bc 1.5x, /images/thumb/NinjaScroll.png/48px-NinjaScroll.png?5e08bc 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ninja_Scroll" title="Ninja Scroll">Ninja Scroll</a></span> while also drawing <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Deus Ex Machina" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Deus_Ex_Machina" title="Deus Ex Machina"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Deus_Ex_Machina" title="Deus Ex Machina">Deus Ex Machina</a></span> or <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Endless Agony" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Endless_Agony" title="Endless Agony"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Uncommon.png?280c75 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Endless_Agony" title="Endless Agony">Endless Agony</a></span>).</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Update_History">Update History</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake?veaction=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Update History" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake?action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Update History"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li><b>Weekly Patch 51: Recursion</b>
<ul><li>Updated relic art for Ring of the Snake.</li></ul></li></ul>
<p><br />
</p>
<div style="clear:both;" class=""></div> 
